   },
   {
    "text": "Installed by Harold D. Speakman Post 356 of the American Legion.",
    "url": "https://www.legion.org/memorials/united-states/pennsylvania/united-states-pennsylvania-narberth-war-memorial"
   },
   {
    "text": "A plaque honoring World War II and Korea service was added in 1955.",
